  after: [
    "Either<IntParseError, Int> has two forms: Right containing a successful Int, and Left containing a failure reason. match chooses the branch; Right count names the enclosed integer count. Left _ ignores the reason and returns the same message.",
    "+12 becomes 12 and -0 becomes 0. 012 and 12px fail, as does the input one above the maximum. ints.format converts the integer to text; + joins it to the label. pub effect fn main is the entry point. fn declares a function; effect marks a function that runs operations such as printing. do runs the println calls in order, writing each string followed by a newline."
